From dfe6c98f4c9556d45c2bf60921f93d95ad4006ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 08:01:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: backport qcom Nord HPASS firmware update

linux-firmware 20261019 ships the HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00003-NORD-6 ADSP
firmware for the Qualcomm Nord chipset. An updated
HPASS.AT.1.0.1-00032-NORD-1 firmware moving Nord to the mainline HPASS
version was merged into linux-firmware.git after the 20261019 release
tag was cut.

Backport the upstream commit updating qcom/nord/adsp.mbn and
adsp_dtb.mbn ahead of the next linux-firmware release, and update the
WHENCE checksum accordingly.

Link: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/commit/?id=a8b74dd14a4b6cdebc27fea7b0644afde2212f3c

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [meta-qcom specific]
---
 ...-firmware-for-Qualcomm-nord-platform.patch | 63595 ++++++++++++++++
 .../linux-firmware/linux-firmware_20261019.bb |     3 +-
 2 files changed, 63597 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-Update-HPASS-firmware-for-Qualcomm-nord-platform.patch

diff --git a/meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-Update-HPASS-firmware-for-Qualcomm-nord-platform.patch b/meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-Update-HPASS-firmware-for-Qualcomm-nord-platform.patch
